e5-linux: keep Unisoc static bearer addresses current during mobility.

The CP may keep a PDP context active while changing its IPv4 address. Start a
netifd-owned event monitor for SIPC data interfaces; it consumes notifications
from the Unisoc plugin and atomically refreshes address, route and DNS without
cycling the bearer. A low-rate consistency check covers lost notifications.

